kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "workspace-api-contract"
purpose: 定义前后端协作所依赖的稳定 API 契约：版本前缀、错误信封、核心端点稳定字段与 SSE 事件最小形状。
valid_scope[2]: apps/,packages/
requirements[50]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r56,API major version prefix is stable,对外业务 API MUST 使用 `/v2` 前缀；同一 major 内保持兼容。健康检查等运维端点 MAY 位于根路径。
  r114,"Optional API key authentication is supported for self-host",DEFERRED(c13)：当 `app.auth.enabled` 且配置鉴权密钥时，`/v2/**` 端点 MUST 要求 Bearer token；未启用时 MAY 匿名访问。当前 v2 运行时尚未强制鉴权。
  r151,"Non-SSE errors use unified envelope","非 SSE 错误响应 MUST 使用统一结构：`errorCode`, `message`, `details?`, `retryAfter?`。"
  r186,Rate limited responses use unified envelope and retryAfter,系统 MUST 为 HTTP rate limiting 提供稳定的对外语义：返回 429，并在统一错误信封中暴露 `retryAfter` 指引。
  r218,Health endpoints remain exempt from HTTP guardrails,系统的健康检查端点 MUST 保持可用于运维探活与诊断，不应因 guardrails 被拒绝。
  r244,Notebook/session/message endpoints are stable,notebook、session、message 的范围归属与 404/400 语义 MUST 稳定。
  r262,"Assistant message content remains plain text while UI is transported out-of-band","系统 MUST 将 assistant 消息 `content: string` 保持为纯文本/markdown 回答；结构化 UI MUST 通过 session-scoped `sharedState.ui` 提供，而不是嵌入 `content`。"
  r273,"Session UI state endpoints are stable and server-authoritative","系统 MUST 提供 session-scoped UI 状态端点： - `GET /v2/notebooks/{notebookId}/sessions/{sessionId}/ui/state` - `POST /v2/notebooks/{notebookId}/sessions/{sessionId}/ui/event` `GET` MUST 返回 `sessionId`、`sharedState`、`sharedStateRevision`；`POST` MUST 接收 `CUSTOM(name=\"ui.v1.event\")`，并返回 `delta` 与最新 `sharedStateRevision`。"
  r280,Commands endpoint is available for autocomplete,系统 MUST 提供 `GET /v2/commands` 端点，供前端获取结构化命令列表以驱动自动补全。
  r63,Prompt presets CRUD endpoints are stable,"系统 MUST 提供 prompt presets 的 CRUD 端点集合： - `GET /v2/prompt-presets`：返回 built-in + custom 的 preset 列表 - `POST /v2/prompt-presets`：创建 custom preset 并返回 201 - `PATCH /v2/prompt-presets/{presetId}`：更新 custom preset 并返回更新后的对象 - `DELETE /v2/prompt-presets/{presetId}`：删除 custom preset 并返回 204"
  r69,"QA endpoints accept in-band prompt directives in question","QA 端点 MUST 支持在 `question: string` 中内嵌 `/prompt:<preset> <query>` 指令，并在启用 presets 功能时以该指令选择受控的预设生成策略。"
  r73,"QA endpoints provide stable stream and non-stream contracts",`/qa` 与 `/qa/stream` MUST 保持稳定字段语义，stream 至少包含 `chunk|done|error` 事件。
  r75,Citation model remains camelCase within the global camelCase wire,citation 对象 MUST 继续使用 camelCase（sourceId/sourceName/chunkId/chunkIndex/pageNumber/paragraphIndex/snippet/score），并与全局 wire camelCase 规则一致；MUST NOT 回退 snake_case。
  r77,Citation context lookup is supported,系统 MUST 提供可按 citation 定位并获取上下文的稳定端点，以支持用户复查证据链。
  r78,Exports can include citations,系统 MUST 支持将 QA/Outputs 导出为包含 citations 的格式（Markdown/JSON 或等价），以便分享与复盘。
  r79,Workspace tools and outputs endpoints are stable,`/v2/workspace/tools` 与 outputs/slides 相关端点 MUST 保持可用与向后兼容；其中 `/v2/workspace/tools` 的“可用工具集合”允许随已安装/已启用插件变化而变化，但响应形状与字段语义 MUST 稳定。
  r17,Workspace tools list returns available tools only,`/v2/workspace/tools` 返回的 tools 列表 MUST 仅包含“当前可用”的工具项（可用 = core 内置能力 + 已安装且已启用、并通过兼容性门禁的插件能力）。对于 `SLIDES`，其可用性 MUST 由当前 active `SlidesWorkflowPlugin` 决定，而不是由 core 默认内置。
  r18,"Tools endpoint exposes diagnostics in a machine-readable form","`/v2/workspace/tools` 响应 MUST 暴露 `diagnostics` 字段，用于解释插件能力为什么可用/不可用，并为 UI 与自托管排障提供可执行提示。 `diagnostics` MUST 至少包含： - `diagnostics.plugins.loaded: string[]`：本次启动加载成功的插件 id 列表 - `diagnostics.plugins.skipped: { [pluginId: string]: { errorCode: string, message: string, hint?: string, details?: object } }`：加载被跳过的插件与稳定 skip detail 为覆盖“官方插件未安装（无 entry point，因此不会出现在 skipped）”的场景，`diagnostics` MUST 额外包含一个轻量的 official catalog（仅字符串/提示，不引入重依赖），用于给出明确的安装/启用指引。 official catalog MUST 覆盖当前版本所定义的**全部官方插件**，包括官方"
  r19,Workspace tools can expose frontendBundle descriptor,`/v2/workspace/tools` 返回的 tool 对象 MUST 支持可选字段 `frontendBundle`，用于声明该输出类型的前端渲染 bundle。
  r20,Workspace tools expose a complete configSchema,`/v2/workspace/tools` 返回的工具对象 MUST 包含可直接驱动 UI 的 `configSchema`（如支持主题、数量/难度选项与默认值）。对于 `SLIDES`，该 `configSchema` MUST 覆盖 defaults、quantity / audience / structure / tone / language / density / theme / frontmatter，以及 active plugin 声明的 engine / preview 相关元数据；客户端 MUST NOT 依赖独立 slides config 端点。
  r21,Tool config endpoint stays consistent (if present),"若 `/v2/workspace/tools/{toolId}/config` 端点存在，其返回值 MUST 与 tools 列表中的 `configSchema` 语义一致。"
  "models-list-must-return-providers-envelope",Models list MUST return providers field on the list envelope (not only separate endpoint),models 列表端点 MUST 在响应 envelope 返回 providers 字段；MAY 另提供 /models/providers。
  "models-must-filter-by-provider-availability",Models endpoints MUST filter by provider availability like v1,models GET list 与 GET single MUST 按 provider 可用性过滤：不可用 provider 的 model 不出现在 list；GET single SHALL 404。
  "sessions-convert-must-honor-message-ids","Sessions convert-to-source and convert-to-output MUST honor messageIds filter","sessions 的 convert-to-source 与 convert-to-output MUST 接受可选 messageIds：仅转换指定消息；缺失 id 时 404。省略 messageIds 时 MAY 转换会话全部消息。"
  "sessions-convert-text-format-must-align-v1",Sessions convert text format MUST match v1 role labels and separators,"sessions convert-to-source MUST 使用中文角色标签与稳定分隔；convert-to-output MUST 使用 raw 文本（无角色前缀）。"
  "models-response-default-shape-must-align-v1","Models response MUST put defaults on envelope (not inline per-model) for list endpoint",models 列表端点 MUST 在 envelope 顶层提供 `defaults`；列表项 MAY 额外携带 isDefaultChat/isDefaultEmbedding。GET single MUST NOT 要求默认标记字段。
  "qa-export-endpoint",API MUST provide QA export endpoint,系统 MUST 提供 QA 导出端点支持 markdown 和 json 两种格式
  "qa-sse-done-shape",QA done SSE event MUST include evidence and context fields,QA 流式 done 事件 MUST 包含 evidence 和 context 和 createdAt 字段
  "qa-response-confidence-field","QA non-streaming response MUST include confidence and evidence",QA 非流式响应 MUST 在 body 中包含 confidence 和 evidence 字段
  "research-resume-infer-state",Resume MUST infer state from persisted steps,research resume 端点 MUST 通过检查已持久化的 steps 推断恢复状态和迭代号，而非强制从头重跑
  "research-control-actions-record-steps",Control endpoints MUST record steps and resume,research 的 approve/modify/skip/finish/cancel 端点 MUST 记录对应的 user_input step 并确保后台 resume
  "research-finish-generates-report",Finish MUST trigger report generation,research finish 端点 MUST 在标记 COMPLETED 后触发最终报告生成并持久化
  "research-delete-endpoint",API MUST provide research delete endpoint,系统 MUST 提供 research 删除端点，在删除前取消运行中的研究
  "research-sse-named-events",Research SSE MUST emit named events,"research 流式端点 MUST 发送带 event: 字段的命名 SSE 事件"
  "error-envelope-actually-emitted-by-routes","Server routes MUST emit the ErrorEnvelope shape not ad-hoc error objects","All non-SSE error responses MUST return the ErrorEnvelope shape defined in packages/shared (errorCode plus message plus optional details plus optional retryAfter). MUST NOT return ad-hoc shapes such as {error: string}."
  "shared-error-envelope-helper","Server MUST provide a shared error-response helper consuming ErrorEnvelopeSchema",The system MUST provide a shared helper (sendError) that consumes ErrorEnvelopeSchema and centralizes HTTP status to errorCode mapping. Feature routers MUST return errors via this helper.
  "slides-config-schema-options-must-be-complete",SLIDES tool configSchema MUST expose all config axes with options and defaults,当 SLIDES 工具在 `/v2/workspace/tools` 响应中可用时，其 `configSchema` MUST 返回完整的 options 列表（每个 option 含 id/label/isDefault）与 defaults 对象，MUST NOT 省略 quantity/audience/structure/tone/language/density/themePreset 等配置轴。
  r284,CitationSchema SSOT is camelCase in packages/shared,packages/shared 的 CitationSchema MUST 以 camelCase 字段作为 Zod SSOT，并驱动 OpenAPI/eden 类型；服务端序列化与前端消费 MUST 直接使用该 schema 推断类型，不得并行维护一套 snake_case Citation 线类型。
  r285,"HTTP JSON wire fields MUST be camelCase end-to-end",除 URL path 与 SSE event 名称外，对外 HTTP/SSE JSON（请求体、查询参数键、响应体、流式 done/error data）的字段名 MUST 为 camelCase，并以 packages/shared Zod 为 SSOT；MUST NOT 再使用 notebook_id/source_ids/created_at/error_code 等 snake_case wire 别名。DB 列名不受本要求约束。
  "notebook-scoped-resource-access","Notebook-scoped resources require notebook boundary",对 source、output、research session、studio slide、task 及 citation 单资源的读取与变更，系统 MUST 能证明请求属于某一 notebook：notebookId（query 或 path）MUST 为必填；当资源存在但不属于该 notebook 时 MUST 返回 404 NOT_FOUND，且 MUST NOT 在缺少 notebook 范围时按全局 id 返回跨 notebook 数据。
  "notebook-scoped-list-forbid-global","Notebook-scoped lists MUST NOT dump all notebooks",笔记本范围列表端点（至少包括 GET /v2/research）在缺少 notebook 过滤时 MUST 拒绝请求（400）；MUST NOT 返回全部 notebook 的聚合列表。
  "domain-errors-use-envelope-and-status",Domain conflicts use AppHttpError envelope,业务状态机非法与乐观锁冲突 MUST 通过 AppHttpError 返回统一 ErrorEnvelope：乐观锁冲突 MUST 使用 409 CONFLICT；非法状态转换 MUST 使用 400 INVALID_REQUEST 或 409 CONFLICT；MUST NOT 用裸 Error 落入非结构化 500，也 MUST NOT 用 NotFoundError 伪装冲突。
  "list-endpoints-use-paginated-envelope",List endpoints MUST use PaginatedSchema envelope,"notebook-scoped 或可增长的列表端点（至少包括 messages、sessions、sources、outputs、research sessions、studio slides、notebook tasks）MUST 接受 PaginationParams（offset/limit）并 MUST 返回 PaginatedSchema 形状：items、total、offset、limit。MUST NOT 再对上述端点返回无 total 的裸数组作为成功响应。"
  "openapi-docs-match-handler-paths",OpenAPI and AsyncAPI paths MUST match handlers,registerApiDoc 与 AsyncAPI 中登记的 path MUST 与 Elysia handler 实际 path 一致；已知漂移（citations context、research stream）MUST 修正。列表端点的 OpenAPI response 描述 MUST 反映 PaginatedSchema 而非裸数组。
  "notebook-scoped-resources-use-nested-paths","Notebook-scoped resources MUST use nested paths","notebook 作用域资源（至少包括 outputs CRUD、research、qa（含 stream/export）、refine（不含 modes）、studio/slides、sources 单资源与 upload）的 canonical HTTP path MUST 为 /v2/notebooks/:nid/<domain>/...。path 中的 :nid MUST 作为 notebook 归属边界；跨 notebook 访问 MUST 返回 404。"
  "flat-notebook-scoped-paths-are-deprecated-aliases","Flat notebook-scoped paths MUST be deprecated aliases",在嵌套路径落地后，旧扁平路径（如 /v2/outputs、/v2/research、/v2/qa）MUST 仅作为 deprecated alias 存在（或在明确窗口后移除）。alias MUST 保留 c67 归属校验语义（query/body notebookId 必填）。一等前端 MUST 改用嵌套路径；文档 MUST 标注旧路径为 deprecated。
  "process-registries-remain-global-flat",Process registry endpoints MUST remain global flat,"进程级 registry 端点 MUST 保持全局扁平且 MUST NOT 嵌套到 /v2/notebooks/:nid/...：至少包括 GET /v2/outputs/types、GET /v2/qa/presets、GET /v2/refine/modes、GET /v2/sources/parsers。另：notebooks 列表、models、commands、prompt-presets、templates、eval、strategies MUST 保持扁平。"
  "nested-path-nid-is-ownership-ssot","Nested path :nid is ownership SSOT","嵌套 canonical 路由上，path :nid MUST 为归属唯一真源；请求 body MUST NOT 再要求必填 notebookId。若 body 携带 notebookId：等于 :nid 时 MUST 忽略；不等于时 MUST 返回 400。响应实体 MAY/SHOULD 继续包含 notebookId 字段。扁平 alias 不受本条约束（仍走 c67 query/body）。"
  "qa-stream-remains-post-with-body",QA stream MUST remain POST with body,交互式 QA SSE（含 notebook 嵌套路径）MUST 使用 POST，并在 body 中携带问题与上下文（sourceIds/策略等）。MUST NOT 要求客户端把大 payload 塞进 query string。
  "progress-streams-use-get","Existing-resource progress streams MUST use GET",对已存在资源的进度/订阅类 SSE（至少 research session stream、studio slides outline/content stream）MUST 使用 GET .../stream。AsyncAPI/OpenAPI 登记的 method 与 path MUST 与实现一致。
scenarios[64]{req_id,id,given,when,then,feature}:
  r56,"client-targets-stable-major-prefix","",客户端调用对外 API,端点 SHALL 使用 `/v2` 前缀且在同一 major 内保持兼容,true
  r114,"auth-enabled-requires-bearer-token-for-v2-deferred","",运维启用鉴权并配置了 API key,客户端请求任意 `/v2/**` 端点若未携带有效 token SHALL 返回 401,true
  r114,"health-endpoints-remain-accessible-without-auth","",运维启用鉴权并配置了 API key,`/health` 与 `/health/dependencies` SHALL 保持匿名可访问以支持探活与运维诊断,true
  r151,"non-sse-error-envelope-is-consistent","",非 SSE 请求发生错误,系统 SHALL 返回统一错误结构并包含 `errorCode` 与 `message`,true
  r186,"client-receives-429-with-retry-guidance","",客户端触发 rate limit,系统 SHALL 返回 429,true
  r218,"health-stays-accessible-while-guardrails-are-enabled","",运维启用 guardrails（非本地暴露或显式 enabled）,`/health` 与 `/health/dependencies` SHALL 仍可匿名访问,true
  r244,"stable-error-semantics-for-ownership-and-validation","",请求引用了不存在或不属于当前 notebook 的 session/message,系统 SHALL 以稳定的 404/400 语义响应,true
  r262,"list-messages-returns-plain-assistant-content","",客户端调用 messages 列表端点获取某条 assistant 消息,响应中的 `content` SHALL 仅包含回答文本,true
  r273,"ui-state-snapshot-restores-a-session","",客户端请求 `/ui/state`,系统 SHALL 返回该 session 当前的完整 `sharedState` snapshot 与 revision,true
  r273,"ui-event-endpoint-is-revision-aware-and-idempotent","",客户端向 `/ui/event` 发送带 `clientRequestId` 与 `baseRevision` 的 `ui.v1.event`,系统 SHALL 做幂等处理与 revision 冲突检查,true
  r280,"commands-endpoint-returns-command-list","",客户端请求 `GET /v2/commands`,系统 SHALL 返回命令列表,true
  r63,"list-includes-built-in-and-custom","","客户端请求 `GET /v2/prompt-presets`","返回列表 SHALL 同时包含 `source=\"builtin\"` 与 `source=\"custom\"` 项（如存在）",true
  r63,"creating-a-preset-returns-409-on-conflicts","","客户端创建一个 trigger 与 built-in 或已存在 custom 冲突的 preset",系统 SHALL 返回 409,true
  r63,"updating-deleting-missing-preset-returns-404","",客户端更新或删除一个不存在的 `presetId`,系统 SHALL 返回 404,true
  r69,"qa-non-stream-respects-prompt-directive","","客户端调用 `/v2/notebooks/{notebookId}/qa` 且 `question` 以 `/prompt:` 开头",系统 SHALL 在不改变 `/v2` payload 字段形状的前提下解析指令并选择对应 preset,true
  r69,"qa-stream-respects-prompt-directive","","客户端调用 `/v2/notebooks/{notebookId}/qa/stream` 且 `question` 以 `/prompt:` 开头",系统 SHALL 解析指令并在 stream 中保持 `chunk|done|error` 的最小事件集语义稳定,true
  r73,"qa-stream-emits-minimal-event-set","",客户端使用 `/qa/stream` 发起问答,stream SHALL 至少包含 `chunk|done|error` 事件并保持字段语义稳定,true
  r73,"qa-stream-carries-shared-ui-state-updates","",客户端使用 `/qa/stream` 发起问答且该回答包含交互 UI,stream SHALL 保持 `chunk|done|error` 的最小事件集稳定,true
  r75,"citation-stays-camelcase-under-c65",c65 全局 camelCase 已生效,读取 QA citations,citation 字段 SHALL 仍为 sourceId/sourceName/chunkId 等 camelCase,true
  r77,"fetch-citation-context","",客户端请求某 citation 的上下文,系统 SHALL 返回片段前后文（或等价上下文）与页码/段落等元信息（如可用）,true
  r78,"export-includes-citation-list","",用户导出 QA 或某个 Output,导出结果 SHALL 包含引用清单与可定位信息（sourceId 或可解析来源标识）,true
  r79,"tools-endpoint-stays-compatible-while-tool-set-is-dynamic","",前端依赖 `/v2/workspace/tools` 获取工具列表,系统 SHALL 保持端点可用且字段语义稳定,true
  r17,"disabled-plugin-removes-tool-but-yields-diagnostics","",某输出类型插件被禁用或加载失败,tools 列表 SHALL 不包含该 tool,true
  r17,"missing-or-ambiguous-slides-plugin-removes-tool-and-yields-d","",系统未加载任何可生效的 slides workflow plugin，或同时发现多个候选但未能唯一确定 active plugin,tools 列表 SHALL 不包含 `SLIDES`,true
  r18,"client-renders-missing-capability-hints","",客户端收到 tools 响应,客户端 SHALL 能定位到缺失/禁用/未安装的插件条目,true
  r19,"tools-response-includes-optional-frontend-bundle","",客户端请求 `/v2/workspace/tools`,每个 tool 对象 MAY 包含 `frontendBundle`,true
  r20,"studio-ui-renders-from-tools-list-only","",客户端请求 `/v2/workspace/tools`,返回的每个 tool SHALL 包含其 `configSchema`（若该 tool 支持配置）,true
  r20,"slides-config-is-derived-from-tools-response-only","",客户端请求 `/v2/workspace/tools`,`SLIDES` tool（若存在） SHALL 在其 `configSchema` 中返回完整配置语义,true
  r21,"config-endpoint-matches-config-schema","","客户端请求 `/v2/workspace/tools/{toolId}/config`",返回的选项集合与默认值语义 SHALL 与对应 tool 的 `configSchema` 一致,true
  "models-list-must-return-providers-envelope","read-providers",前端读 GET /models 响应的 providers 字段,系统返回 models list,envelope SHALL 含 providers 字段（与 v1 一致）,true
  "models-must-filter-by-provider-availability","unconfigured-provider-model",某 model 的 provider 未配置,系统返回 models list / GET single,该 model SHALL 不出现在 list；GET single SHALL 404,true
  "sessions-convert-must-honor-message-ids","convert-subset","客户端传 messageIds=[1,3] 转换","系统执行 convert-to-source/output",SHALL 仅转换消息 1 与 3；缺失 id → 404,true
  "sessions-convert-text-format-must-align-v1","convert-text-format",用户转换 session 为 source/output,系统生成文本,"source 用中文角色标签 + \\n\\n；output 用 raw 文本（与 v1 一致）",true
  "models-response-default-shape-must-align-v1","defaults-envelope",前端读 GET /models 的默认 model,系统返回 list,`defaults.chat`/`defaults.embedding` SHALL 在 envelope 顶层（非每 model 内联）,true
  "qa-export-endpoint","markdown-export",一个 session 有 assistant 回答,客户端请求 GET /v2/qa/export?sessionId=X&format=markdown,"系统 SHALL 返回 text/markdown 内容含 question/answer/citations 三段结构及 Content-Disposition header",true
  "qa-sse-done-shape","done-event-fields",QA 流式完成,done 事件发出,事件 payload SHALL 包含 evidence 和 context 和 createdAt 和 confidence 和 citations 和 messageId,true
  "qa-response-confidence-field","non-streaming-response",客户端发送非流式 QA 请求,响应返回,响应 body SHALL 包含 confidence 和 evidence 字段,true
  "research-resume-infer-state","resume-after-search",研究在第 2 轮搜索后中断,用户调 resume,系统 SHALL 推断 SEARCHING 状态和 iteration=2，从断点恢复而非重跑,true
  "research-control-actions-record-steps","skip-action",研究在 WAITING_USER 等待用户决策,用户调 skip,系统 SHALL 记录 skip step 并推进 iteration 然后恢复,true
  "research-finish-generates-report","finish-with-results",研究积累了多轮搜索结果,用户调 finish,系统 SHALL 生成最终报告并存入 finalReport 字段,true
  "research-delete-endpoint","delete-running",研究正在运行,用户调 delete,系统 SHALL 先取消运行中的研究再删除记录,true
  "research-sse-named-events","plan-ready-event",研究生成了搜索计划,SSE 流发出 plan_ready,"事件 SHALL 包含 event: plan_ready 行",true
  "error-envelope-actually-emitted-by-routes","non-sse-error-shape",a feature router such as POST /v2/outputs hits a predictable error (sourceId out of scope or SLIDES guard or schema validation failure),the system returns an error response,"the body MUST match ErrorEnvelopeSchema (with errorCode and message) and MUST NOT be {error: string} or any other ad-hoc shape",true
  "error-envelope-actually-emitted-by-routes","field-name-is-message",the client triggers a 400 error such as a missing field,the system returns an error response,the message field MUST be named message (aligned with ErrorEnvelopeSchema) and MUST NOT be named error,true
  "shared-error-envelope-helper","single-helper-source",a developer adds a new error branch in a feature router,returning the error via the shared helper,the helper output MUST be consistent with other routers and errorCode MUST come from the centralized mapping table not a custom string,true
  "slides-config-schema-options-must-be-complete","slides-config-options-all-present",the SLIDES tool is available (returned in /v2/workspace/tools),a client reads the SLIDES tool's configSchema,"the configSchema MUST contain non-empty quantityOptions, audienceOptions, structureOptions, toneOptions, languageOptions, densityOptions, and themePresetOptions arrays, plus a defaults object; each option MUST have id, label, and isDefault fields",true
  r284,"shared-citation-schema-camelcase",CitationSchema 已更新为 camelCase,服务端构建 citations 或前端类型检查 Citation,两端 SHALL 共用同一 camelCase 字段集且类型检查通过,true
  r285,"qa-request-response-camelcase",客户端调用 QA 或 messages 等核心端点,检查请求与响应 JSON 键名,SHALL 仅出现 camelCase 键（如 notebookId/sourceIds/createdAt），且 MUST NOT 依赖 snake_case 键,true
  r285,"no-snake-compat-layer",服务端已切换为 camelCase wire,客户端仍发送 notebook_id 等 snake_case 字段,系统 SHALL 按校验失败或忽略未知键处理，MUST NOT 同时接受两套字段名作为正式合约,true
  "notebook-scoped-resource-access","cross-notebook-source-get-404",存在属于 notebook A 的 source,客户端用 notebook B 的 notebookId 请求该 source,系统 SHALL 返回 404 NOT_FOUND 且响应为 ErrorEnvelope,false
  "notebook-scoped-resource-access","missing-notebook-id-rejected",客户端调用需归属校验的 source/output 单资源端点且省略 notebookId,发送请求,系统 SHALL 拒绝该请求（400 校验失败或等价）且 MUST NOT 返回跨本资源体,false
  "notebook-scoped-list-forbid-global","research-list-requires-notebook",系统中存在多个 notebook 的 research session,客户端调用 GET /v2/research 且省略 notebookId,系统 SHALL 拒绝全表列举（400）且 MUST NOT 返回全部 session,false
  "domain-errors-use-envelope-and-status","session-revision-conflict-409",客户端以过期 sharedStateRevision 更新 session,发生乐观锁冲突,系统 SHALL 返回 409 CONFLICT 与 ErrorEnvelope，且 MUST NOT 返回伪装的 404,false
  "list-endpoints-use-paginated-envelope","messages-list-returns-paginated",会话中存在多条消息,客户端以 offset/limit 调用 GET messages,响应 SHALL 含 items 与 total 且 items 长度不超过 limit,false
  "list-endpoints-use-paginated-envelope","research-list-paginated-with-notebook",notebook 下存在 research sessions,客户端携带 notebookId 与分页参数调用 GET /v2/research,响应 SHALL 为 PaginatedSchema 且不得返回其他 notebook 的 session,false
  "openapi-docs-match-handler-paths","citations-context-doc-path","实现路径为 /v2/notebooks/:nid/citations/context",检查 registerApiDoc 登记,文档 path SHALL 与实现一致且 MUST NOT 再登记过时的 /v2/citations/context 为唯一真源,false
  "notebook-scoped-resources-use-nested-paths","nested-outputs-list",存在 notebook N 与若干 outputs,客户端调用 GET /v2/notebooks/N/outputs,响应 SHALL 成功列出该 notebook 的 outputs,false
  "notebook-scoped-resources-use-nested-paths","nested-cross-notebook-404",output 属于 notebook A,"客户端以 notebook B 调用 GET /v2/notebooks/B/outputs/:id",响应 SHALL 为 404,false
  "flat-notebook-scoped-paths-are-deprecated-aliases","flat-alias-still-works-while-deprecated",嵌套路径与扁平 alias 均已挂载,客户端仍调用旧扁平 /v2/outputs?notebookId=N,响应 SHALL 仍可用且文档/标注 SHALL 表明 deprecated,false
  "process-registries-remain-global-flat","outputs-types-stays-flat",系统已挂载嵌套 outputs,客户端调用 GET /v2/outputs/types,响应 SHALL 成功且 MUST NOT 要求 notebook 路径前缀,false
  "nested-path-nid-is-ownership-ssot","nested-post-without-body-notebook-id",存在 notebook N,客户端 POST /v2/notebooks/N/outputs 且 body 省略 notebookId,请求 SHALL 被接受（其余字段合法时）并以 N 为归属,false
  "nested-path-nid-is-ownership-ssot","nested-post-mismatched-body-notebook-id",存在 notebook N,客户端 POST /v2/notebooks/N/outputs 且 body.notebookId=M（M≠N）,响应 SHALL 为 400,false
  "qa-stream-remains-post-with-body","qa-stream-post",notebook 与 sources 就绪,"客户端 POST /v2/notebooks/:nid/qa/stream（或等价 canonical）携带 body",服务端 SHALL 以 SSE 流式返回且 MUST NOT 要求 GET+query 传全文,false
  "progress-streams-use-get","research-stream-get",research session 已创建,"客户端 GET .../research/:id/stream",服务端 SHALL 以 SSE 推送进度且文档 method SHALL 为 GET,false
